# An allow-list: everything is left out of a build, then three things are let in.
#
# The laptop tool keeps the studio's real ledger in data/, beside the code. A
# list of things to leave out would have to be right every time a file is
# added; a list of things to let in cannot leak what nobody named. So the
# first line below shuts everything out, and each line after it starts with "!".
# Keep it that way: tests/test_repo_hygiene.py and the image job in CI hold it.
*
!moneyd/
!index.html
!vendor/
